      <h1>Spectra EQ — free Windows system equalizer</h1>
      <p>A 10-band graphic EQ and a live 20 Hz to 10 kHz spectrum. Turn the knobs and every sound you play can change: YouTube, games, Spotify, and the rest.</p>
      <p><strong style="color:#fff;">Equalizer APO is required first.</strong> Install that once, tick your Speakers, reboot, then press EQ ON in Spectra. Without it, the knobs cannot change system sound.</p>
